OL,3,GNEWSAConquest coins on show for Bayeux
OL,4,ATapestry buzz
OL,5,
OL,6,FA selection of 11th Century coins are
OL,7,Fon display at Lincoln castle to
OL,8,Fcoincide with the Bayeux Tapestry's
OL,9,Farrival in the UK.
OL,11,FThe eight coins, minted in Lincoln,
OL,12,Fshow the three Kings depicted on the
OL,13,Ffamous embroidery of the events leading
OL,14,Fup to the Battle of Hastings
OL,16,FThe display is part of the Bayeux
OL,17,FAround Britain national programme
OL,18,Forganised by the British Museum which
OL,19,Fis currently displaying the historic
OL,20,Fembroidery.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
