OL,3,GNEWSAConquest coins on show for Bayeux
OL,4,ATapestry buzz
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Johanne Porter, the curator of the
OL,7,Fexhibit, said it was a "really exciting
OL,8,Fopportunity" to see the 960-year-old
OL,9,Fcoins alongside the Castle's copy of
OL,10,FMagna Carta.
